1
00:00:00,977 --> 00:00:02,707
(Stuart:)Raj, if it's
any consolation,

2
00:00:02,712 --> 00:00:05,752
(Stuart:)I'm no better off than
I was ten years ago.

3
00:00:05,749 --> 00:00:08,279
Oh, yay!

4
00:00:08,285 --> 00:00:10,585
(Raj:)I have a doctorate
in astrophysics

5
00:00:10,587 --> 00:00:12,157
(Raj:)and I'm every bit as awesome

6
00:00:12,155 --> 00:00:14,825
(Raj:)as the pasty-faced owner
of a comic book store!

7
00:00:14,824 --> 00:00:17,394
Raj! Show some compassion.

8
00:00:17,394 --> 00:00:20,424
(Sheldon:)Those are things that
we think but don't say.

9
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,730
(Raj:)Excuse me.

10
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:28,770
(Leonard:)Sorry, Stuart.

11
00:00:28,772 --> 00:00:31,202
(Stuart:)Hey, I'm in a hospital
and I'm not the patient.

12
00:00:31,207 --> 00:00:33,037
(Stuart:)I'm fine.

13
00:00:34,177 --> 00:00:35,647
(Howard:)Come on, Bernie, breathe.

14
00:00:35,645 --> 00:00:37,715
(Howard:)Remember what you learned
in birthing class.

15
00:00:37,714 --> 00:00:39,744
(Bernadette:)I remember thinking,
“This is stupid”"

16
00:00:39,749 --> 00:00:42,549
and I was right!

17
00:00:42,552 --> 00:00:44,222
(Howard:)Do you want me
to get the nurse?

18
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:47,090
No! If one more person puts
their fingers near my uterus,

19
00:00:47,090 --> 00:00:50,330
(Bernadette:)I'm gonna cross my legs
and snap 'em off!

20
00:00:54,597 --> 00:00:57,167
(Leonard:)I've come to peace with my
relationship with my parents.

